            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="true" file_name=""><![CDATA[The ratio of the external angle is equal to the sum of the ratios of the internal angles not adjacent to it. Hence, the external angles of the triangle are rationed as 7:6:5.]]></content>
